1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:03,950
Bonjour. Here is the revised merge workflow.

2
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:07,580
First, compare the clusters.

3
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:15,760
Hold Control to combine two suggestions, then press G to
merge.

4
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:24,810
Now make an unrelated merge, and mark it as multi-unit
activity.

5
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,570
Return to the older merge.

6
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,750
Restore its parents in Merge Mode.

7
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:38,730
Undo and redo affect only this restoration.

8
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:42,470
Leaving Merge Mode keeps these parents alive.

9
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:47,330
Exclude one parent, and add a new candidate with Control-
click.

10
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:52,620
Merge the new combination and save.

11
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:57,630
Reopening preserves the result, the excluded parent, and
the later edits.
